# shared/

Pure TypeScript — no Convex or browser APIs.

- Zod schemas, money math, validation rules, and cross-layer message strings belong here.
- Prefer **`/tdd`** when adding or changing business logic.
- Primary home for unit tests (`*.test.ts` colocated with source).

Before adding logic in `src/lib/` or `convex/lib/`, check whether it already belongs in `shared/`.
